Return JSON only. Dates YYYY-MM-DD (resolve words like tomorrow, Friday, بكرة from today). time HH:mm 24h ("8 pm", "8 مساءً", "الساعة 8 مساء" -> "20:00"; "10am" -> "10:00"). guests a number as text. Use "" for anything not given or not relevant.
